# Go module

- `internal/api` — thin door: validate JSON, rate limit, call compute. No Redis, no detectors.
- `internal/compute` — engine: detect, mask, correspondence store, admin, stats.
- api ↔ compute at **package level** (function calls), not HTTP. HTTP layer is `cmd/server`.
- Put to Redis **before** 200 on new mask. Demask/lookup skips detect semaphore.
- Partial etalon-style masks on hot path; FPE/synthetic after must.
- Logs/metrics: types and offsets only — never PII values.
- No comments in code. `gofmt` + `go vet` before done.
- Ownership: respect track globs (api / detect / mask / store). See `docs/agents/OWNERSHIP.md`.